        <fullName>Warranty_Coverage_Query_16jfcef94887f25</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Use this subagent when a dealer asks what is covered, excluded, or eligible under a vehicle’s warranty.</description>
        <developerName>Warranty_Coverage_Query_16jfcef94887f25</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a dealer asks about what is covered under a vehicle’s warranty, ask for the vehicle VIN if it is not already available. Call the &quot;Validate Vehicle Warranty&quot; action using the provided VIN to retrieve warranty details. If the warranty is inactive or expired, clearly inform the dealer and stop further explanation. If the warranty is active, explain the covered categories and exclusions clearly and plainly, using simple and easy‑to‑understand language.</description>
